  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>:</mo></math>&nbsp;Ramu is intelligent</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>:</mo></math>&nbsp;Ramu is rich</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>:</mo></math>&nbsp;Ramu is not honest</p><p>Given statement, &quot;Ramu is intelligent and honest if and only if Ramu is not rich&quot;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8660;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>Q</mi></math></p><p>So, negation of the statement is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8660;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>[using <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8660;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>]</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>[by using<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>]</p></blockquote>"
